new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..c69743aad098fa41a14058cf3737a6942be7111a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/KIO-FORK.md
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# KIO Vector
+
+Independent KIO branding fork of [VectorCraft v0.11.0](https://github.com/storytold/vectorcraft/tree/0a33cff3f6e2a1e9e672f4c3816f58cd8d3d032e), originally by the ArtCraft team and contributors. KIO branding is not endorsed by ArtCraft.
+
+Original engine, codecs, formats and features are retained. Original LICENSE, NOTICE, contributor credits and asset attribution remain applicable and are preserved. KIO icon is the existing user-supplied KIO artwork; no ArtCraft trademark logo is included.
+
+Inherited limitations: Alpha vector editor. Illustrator editing-data exchange and exact tool behavior remain incomplete; Affinity import only.
+
+This patch has not been compiled or functionally verified. Do not describe it as a completed native release until the platform build, profile separation and file round-trip checks pass.
